{"2593740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Operation Terra", "steam_appid": 2593740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Terra is a a science fiction First Person Shooter/Role Playing Game where you pave the way for mankind's resettlement on its new Earth, Terra, while fighting relentless machines hellbent on stopping you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.poster.avif?t=1781106912\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.webm?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.mp4?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight drones, droids, robots, tanks, turrets. Their sole objective is to make it all impossible. Collect permanent bonuses and power ups lying throughout the levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.poster.avif?t=1781106912\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.webm?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.mp4?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near infinite procedurally generated maps and level layouts give you the option to go for a playthrough that is never the same. Roam levels where you have already completed a mission for more stats and credits farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.poster.avif?t=1781106912\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.webm?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.mp4?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons and gear with credits looted on the missions. Buy permanent upgrades in the base. Earn clearance to access new parts of the base. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique tiles sets overall, paired with 2-4 different texture sets each. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character progression system that is exponential. You get more Skill Points the more you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable parts of the base with more shops for you to buy goodies at.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biochips that add to your basic stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An equipment upgrade system that not only adds to, but also multiplies your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission Points earned by finishing missions and used to purchase special permanent upgrades around the base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different Powers that add variety to the gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                              <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/182825469915f254877dcba29aa8a136.avif?t=1781106912\" width=374 height=448 /></span>                                           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Terra is a a science fiction First Person Shooter/Role Playing Game where you pave the way for mankind's resettlement on its new Earth, Terra, while fighting relentless machines hellbent on stopping you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.poster.avif?t=1781106912\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.webm?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.mp4?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight drones, droids, robots, tanks, turrets. Their sole objective is to make it all impossible. Collect permanent bonuses and power ups lying throughout the levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.poster.avif?t=1781106912\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.webm?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.mp4?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near infinite procedurally generated maps and level layouts give you the option to go for a playthrough that is never the same. Roam levels where you have already completed a mission for more stats and credits farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.poster.avif?t=1781106912\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.webm?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.mp4?t=1781106912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons and gear with credits looted on the missions. Buy permanent upgrades in the base. Earn clearance to access new parts of the base. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique tiles sets overall, paired with 2-4 different texture sets each. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character progression system that is exponential. You get more Skill Points the more you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable parts of the base with more shops for you to buy goodies at.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biochips that add to your basic stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An equipment upgrade system that not only adds to, but also multiplies your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission Points earned by finishing missions and used to purchase special permanent upgrades around the base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different Powers that add variety to the gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                              <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/182825469915f254877dcba29aa8a136.avif?t=1781106912\" width=374 height=448 /></span>                                           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Operation Terra is a First Person Shooter/Role Playing Game with roguelite elements. Lead mankind to its new Earth. Fight droids and machines. Loot credits and power ups. Complete missions to unlock permanent bonuses. Maps and levels procedurally generated. No micro transactions or in-app purchases.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/620837d21c36f1bbdf7d35416387e8448668fd5f/header.jpg?t=1781106912", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/3ea442e134f2939383bbf6347b20e1649b955e6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781106912", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/3ea442e134f2939383bbf6347b20e1649b955e6f/